  },
  "cultural_traits": {
    "alias": "Ironman",
    "style": "Emotional/Raw",
    "lyric_reference": "All That I Got Is You"
  },
  "lesson_focus": "Vulnerability as Strength"
}
```

### **Interactive Features**
1.  **3D Solar Orbit (WebGL):** A visual model where RZA is the center. Users can spin the system to see how "orbits" (collaborations) intersect [36].
2.  **The "Time Capsule" Archive:** Based on RZA's concept for the tour [37], this section contains "Oral Tradition" audio clips—rare facts about planetary formation and Wu-Tang history [38].
3.  **Synergy Calculator:** A logic game where users must balance "Chaos" (ODB/Neptune) with "Order" (Masta Killa/Saturn) to maintain a stable orbit [39].

